{"id":"c7ddd9dada5543af","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation.md","title":"Unique multi-affine interpolation of vertex values","display":"thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation — Unique multi-affine interpolation of vertex values","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation","aliases":["27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation"],"display":"thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation — Unique multi-affine interpolation of vertex values","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]]","[[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]","[[27-thm-pbpoly]]","[[27-df-pbextension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.1","source_statement":"Definition 13.7; multilinear interpolation consequence","source_printed_pages":"579–580","source_pdf_pages":"603–604","verification_status":"proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation — Unique multi-affine interpolation of vertex values"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c57bdf80f8f006ca\" href=\"?note=c57bdf80f8f006ca\" title=\"27-df-pbpolynomialextension\">27-df-pbpolynomialextension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"196449e4ff7c48d2\" href=\"?note=196449e4ff7c48d2\" title=\"27-df-bernoulliproduct\">27-df-bernoulliproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3153aa2be8b0a164\" href=\"?note=3153aa2be8b0a164\" title=\"27-thm-pbpoly\">27-thm-pbpoly</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Definition 13.7; multilinear interpolation consequence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"579–580"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"603–604"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolExt},\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PolExt},\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c57bdf80f8f006ca\" href=\"?note=c57bdf80f8f006ca\" title=\"27-df-pbpolynomialextension\">27-df-pbpolynomialextension</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_p\">\\(\\beta_p\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"196449e4ff7c48d2\" href=\"?note=196449e4ff7c48d2\" title=\"27-df-bernoulliproduct\">27-df-bernoulliproduct</a>），规范多项式重构（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3153aa2be8b0a164\" href=\"?note=3153aa2be8b0a164\" title=\"27-thm-pbpoly\">27-thm-pbpoly</a>）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad \\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad \\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n\\quad g=\\mathrm{PolExt}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n\\quad g=\\mathrm{PolExt}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是规范多项式表示在实立方体上的局部推论，不冒充原书另一编号定理。重构定理给出顶点相等；每个平方自由单项式对单坐标仿射。对任意 multi-affine g，反复展开 g(p)=(1-p_i)g(p^{i←0})+p_i g(p^{i←1})，n次后得到顶点和，因而唯一；n=0 时直接为唯一顶点值。代入 g=PolExt 即得有限插值公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbpolynomialextension","status":"resolved","id":"c57bdf80f8f006ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bernoulliproduct","status":"resolved","id":"196449e4ff7c48d2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep