rm{MultiAffine}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad \\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)=\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)f(a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\cap\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n\\quad g=\\mathrm{PolExt}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1915,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-495","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation|thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation — Unique multi-affine interpolation of vertex values]]"},{"id":"f22777763c64bcce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$p\\in U_n$；$\\beta_p,\\mathbb E_p$（see [[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]），$\\mathrm{PolExt}$ 及有限插值式（see [[27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"}],"outgoing":["c57bdf80f8f006ca","196449e4ff7c48d2","3153aa2be8b0a164","53f1b3025ce14af2"]}